Hey, what's up everyone.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.580
My name is Tway,

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.120
and welcome to a whole new
season of "Making It Big."

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.693
The show where I turn your
favorite foods, giant.

00:00:11.693 --> 00:00:13.290
- What?
- Oh, my God.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.210
- This is so big.
- Oh!

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.800
- I'm a chef and content creator.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.810
I share really easy-to-follow recipes,

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.042
most of them being
Vietnamese recipes because...

00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:21.875
